OL,5,G0200 Skin A&E
OL,6,     FThirty-seven-year-old Richard
OL,7,     Fcomes to the clinic with a large
OL,8,     Flipoma on the back of his neck,
OL,9,     Fbut when Dr Natalia goes in to
OL,10,     Fremove it, she's astounded by what
OL,11,     Fshe finds.
OL,12,G0245 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,13,     FIhor shares cancer concerns,
OL,14,     FSharon discusses her distressing
OL,15,     Fcouncil flat conditions, and Emma
OL,16,     Fstruggles with Long Covid
OL,17,     Fsymptoms, preventing her from
OL,18,     Freturning to her full-time job.
OL,19,G0335 Home and Away
